---
layout: layouts/base.njk
current: changelog
title: What's new
permalink: /changelog/
description: "What's new in Program Partner, newest first: dated changes to the program office for band, orchestra, choir, theatre and private studios."
---
{#- Entries from Program Partner's What's new list (src/_data/changelog.js, scripts/whats-new.mjs), newest first.
    Each has a stable anchor, its id, so a link to one keeps working when newer entries go in above it; an entry from
    before the list also keeps the anchor its date and title gave it then. An entry stamped to the minute shows its time
    in Eastern Time; older ones show their date, or month. -#}
{% import "macros.njk" as m %}
{%- set c = changelog -%}
{{ m.hero({ eyebrow: "Changelog", title: c.heading, subhead: c.intro }, site, shots) }}
<section aria-label="Changes" style="padding:0 0 var(--section-y)">
<div class="wrap-narrow">
<ol class="changelog">
{%- for e in c.entries %}
<li id="{{ e.id }}">
{%- if e.legacyAnchor and e.legacyAnchor != e.id %}<span id="{{ e.legacyAnchor }}" aria-hidden="true"></span>{% endif %}
<p class="when"><time datetime="{{ e.datetime }}">{{ e.label }}</time></p>
<h2><a href="#{{ e.id }}">{{ e.title }}</a></h2>
<p>{{ e.body }}</p>
{%- if e.link %}
<p><a href="{{ e.link }}">Read more</a></p>
{%- endif %}
</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ol>
<p class="changelog-follow"><a href="/changelog/feed.xml">Follow What's new by RSS</a></p>
{%- if c.woodshed and c.woodshed.length %}
<aside class="changelog-woodshed" aria-labelledby="latest-woodshed-h">
<h2 id="latest-woodshed-h" class="h2-sm">Latest in Woodshed</h2>
<ul>
{%- for e in c.woodshed %}
<li><a href="https://woodshedpractice.com/whats-new#{{ e.id }}">{{ e.title }}</a> <span class="when"><time datetime="{{ e.datetime }}">{{ e.label }}</time></span></li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
<p><a href="https://woodshedpractice.com/whats-new">Everything new in Woodshed</a></p>
</aside>
{%- endif %}
</div>
</section>
{{ m.cta("See what's there today.", site.ctaPrimary, "/demo/") }}
